        "title": "Madeira",
        "summary": "Run Windows PC games on a non-jailbroken iPhone. Madeira combines https://www.winehq.org/ ARM64EC, https://github.com/FEX-Emu/FEX for x86-64 → ARM64 translation, and https://github.com/3Shain/DXMT for D3D11 → Metal, running as a single Mach process on iOS with wineserver as a thread rather than a separate process. Thumper and ULTRAKILL are playable. Marvel Cosmic Invasion has reached gameplay, though a run has also ended in an unexplained termination and its controls are not yet reliable. Others reach gameplay at low frame rates. This is a research project, not a product: expect rough edges, per-title quirks and breaking changes.",
